      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A new and novel non-SSRI potential treatment option for major depressive disorders is Valdoxen (agomelatine) which is currently in phase III clinical studies. Valdoxen is a norepinephrine disinhibitor (NNDI) and is also an antagonist of the 5-HT(2C) receptor."},
